      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "A number of our companions, from Sahl Bin Ziyad, from Al Hassan Bin Mahboub, from Abu Ayoub Al Khaza, from Muhammad Bin Muslim, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Ja’far<sup>asws</sup> that the (legislated) shares (of inheritances) cannot happen to be more than six shares’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "5. A number of our people have narrated from Sahl ibn Ziyad from al-Hassan ibn Mahbub from abu Ayyub al-Khazzaz from Muhammad ibn Muslim who has narrated the following: “Abu Ja‘far, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘The ordained shares are not more than six.’” "
        ]
      }
